OL,3,AGTA 6 sales hit $3.8bn in a single day
OL,4,A- the biggest entertainment launch in
OL,5,Ahistory
OL,6,
OL,7,FTo compare, Spider-Man: Brand New Day,
OL,8,Fthis year's highest-grossing film so
OL,9,Ffar, made $2.5bn (#1.8bn) over its
OL,10,Fentire run in cinemas.
OL,12,FInternet infrastructure firm Cloudflare
OL,13,Fsaid earlier that PS5 downloads in the
OL,14,FUK peaked at 8.6 times normal levels
OL,15,Faround its launch.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
