OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATech stock sell-off drags markets down
OL,4,Aas Anthropic shares slide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose pressures combined to weigh on US
OL,7,Fmarkets through Friday, with all key US
OL,8,Findexes closing sharply down on the
OL,9,Fday, furthering earlier falls over the
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FThe S&P 500 and the Dow Jones
OL,13,FIndustrial Average were pushed into
OL,14,Fcorrection territory, a point where
OL,15,Fthey are trading at 10% or more down
OL,16,Ffrom a recent high.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
