OL,3,ATrump threatens ban on US firms
OL,4,Abuilding AI data centres overseas
OL,5,
OL,6,FTech giants including Meta and Google
OL,7,Fhave entered agreements to build data
OL,8,Fcentres overseas. It remains unclear
OL,9,Fhow such a policy would be enforced if
OL,10,Fit was brought in.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
